After installing [Mise](https://mise.jdx.dev/), build the documentation:

```shell
cd docs/
```
```shell
mise run build
```

To preview changes locally:

```shell
mise run serve
```

Mise installs UV, which installs the required Python version and project dependencies.

This will publish the documentation at [localhost:8000](http://localhost:8000/) by default, and watch for any changes to the documentation source files.

